    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are trained for long travel, navigation, and fighting across coasts, rivers, and open water.</p><p><strong>Bonus Proficiencies.</strong> You gain proficiency with Martial Weapons, Cartographer’s Tools, and Navigator’s Tools.</p><p><strong>Eye of the Navigator.</strong> When someone makes a History, Survival, or Perception check to locate or learn where a place is, you can choose to give them a +5 bonus to their roll. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Wisdom Modifier, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest</p><p><strong>Powerful Swimmer.</strong> You have a Swim Speed equal to your Speed, and you can hold your breath for twice as long as normal.</p><ul><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.lyonesse.Item.1a4595b5df7c5cb9]{Eye of the Navigator}</li></ul>"
    },
